  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BURN. Vocational Training for a new Manufacturing Facility in Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norad&apos;s support is covering travel costs and first four months of team salaries for a new cookstove manufacturing facility in Ghana. Facility managers will spend a month in Kenya training under their Kenyan counterparts. Their Kenyan counterparts and management staff will  travel to Ghana</narrative>
  </description>
